# Root build context (BUILD_PLAN.md §5.1 point 6). Apps moved to the root
# workspace build from the repo root and COPY only the folders they need; this
# file keeps build output, local state and secrets out of that context.
# Apps not moved yet still build from their own folder with their own
# .dockerignore.
**/node_modules
**/.medusa
**/.next
**/.cache
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/coverage
*/backend/uploads
*/backend/static
**/*.log
**/docker-compose*.yml
